            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-94] Double callbacks in readLastConfirmedOp which fails readLastConfirmed operation even received enough valid responses.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-94</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As comment in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-93&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;BOOKKEEPER-93 &lt;/a&gt;, double callbacks happen even it success callback receiving enough valid responses.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12528801">BOOKKEEPER-94</key>
            <summary>Double callbacks in readLastConfirmedOp which fails readLastConfirmed operation even received enough valid responses.</summary>
