                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13135962" author="ikelly" created="Wed, 26 Oct 2011 13:26:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;BookieReadWriteTest#testLastConfirmedAdd is failing on trunk due to this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13135973" author="hustlmsp" created="Wed, 26 Oct 2011 13:35:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;check whether the operation is completed or not when callback.&lt;br/&gt;
also change &lt;b&gt;notComplete&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;b&gt;completed&lt;/b&gt; and using condition &lt;b&gt;!completed&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;since we have BookieReadWriteTest#testLastConfirmedAdd / BookieReadWriteTest#testReadOpenLedger for readLastConfirmed, no new test cases will be added.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13135999" author="ikelly" created="Wed, 26 Oct 2011 14:07:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Committed r1189225. Thanks Sijie.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
